rooms_desc ({"You have arrived in what looks like a walled, open, pavilion-like,stone platform.  This is the Great Hall.  As you look around, yourealize that the Hall rests within the branches of a massive treenestled in the midst of a forested island.  Trees border on allsides, the boughs of which form a floral canopy above.  Additionalstructures border on all sides -- cradled within the branches of neighboring trees and connected by stone walkways.  The structureto the north is open like this one, all the others (eight in all),are small, enclosed buildings.  You can see snow-capped mountainsfar to the east and west and you hear the distant rumble of twomassive waterfalls that cascade from the mountains -- feeding the small lake that surrounds this arboreal island.  Angry riverscourse north and south from the lake.  The Hall is 50ft longby 40ft wide with a large fire-pit in the center -- encircledby four, crescent-shaped tables with four chairs each.  Largetorches sit atop the short wall and flank the four exits.  Large,life-like statues of wolves, howling with heads arced, sit in thefour corners.  There is also a small, bronze sign to the right ofthe north exit that attracts your attention.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","Th