items ({({"Fire-pit","A 10ft diameter hearth big enough for a good-sized bonfire","Trees","They appear to be massive oak-like trees of an unfamiliar species","Mountains","They are misty, snow-capped mountains of majestic beauty","Statues","These marble statues are truly life-like. They almost seem to breath....","Statue","The workmanship is the finest you've seen. It seems to be carved from marble","Table","A sturdy, hardwood table","Tables","Sturdy, hardwood tables","Chair","A comfortable, high-backed chair of sturdy hardwood","Chairs","Comfortable, high-backed chairs fo sturdy hardwood","Walkways","Stone, walled walkways that connect the various rooms of the tree-house","structures","These are the individual rooms of the tree-house, connected by short walkways","Sing","","sign","It reads: **WELCOME!** Please, have a <look> around and make yourself at home:)",}),0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
